{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schema/check.v1.json",
  "id": "musk/automation/no-skipped-tests",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "area": "automation",
  "cardinality": "singleton",
  "dimension": "automation.skipped-tests",
  "minSeverity": null,
  "params": {},
  "impl": {
    "kind": "pattern",
    "patterns": {
      "typescript": [
        {
          "id": "skipped-tests",
          "utils": {
            "runtime-ref": {
              "any": [
                { "kind": "identifier" },
                { "kind": "member_expression" },
                { "kind": "call_expression" },
                { "kind": "await_expression" }
              ]
            },
            "cond-wrapper": {
              "any": [
                { "kind": "parenthesized_expression" },
                { "kind": "as_expression" },
                { "kind": "satisfies_expression" },
                { "kind": "non_null_expression" },
                { "kind": "unary_expression", "has": { "field": "operator", "regex": "^!$" } }
              ]
            },
            "truthy-value": {
              "any": [
                { "kind": "string" },
                { "kind": "template_string" },
                { "kind": "true" },
                { "kind": "arrow_function" },
                { "kind": "function_expression" },
                { "kind": "generator_function" },
                { "kind": "class" },
                { "kind": "object" },
                { "kind": "array" },
                { "kind": "new_expression" },
                { "kind": "sequence_expression" },
                { "kind": "spread_element" },
                { "kind": "identifier", "regex": "^globalThis$" }
              ]
            },
            "always-truthy": {
              "any": [
                { "matches": "truthy-value" },
                {
                  "matches": "cond-wrapper",
                  "has": {
                    "stopBy": { "not": { "matches": "cond-wrapper" } },
                    "matches": "truthy-value"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "runtime-skip": {
              "all": [
                {
                  "inside": {
                    "stopBy": "end",
                    "any": [
                      { "kind": "arrow_function" },
                      { "kind": "function_expression" },
                      { "kind": "function_declaration" },
                      { "kind": "method_definition" }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "has": {
                    "field": "arguments",
                    "all": [
                      {
                        "has": {
                          "nthChild": { "position": 1, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } },
                          "not": { "matches": "always-truthy" },
                          "any": [
                            { "matches": "runtime-ref" },
                            { "has": { "stopBy": "end", "matches": "runtime-ref" } }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "has": {
                          "nthChild": { "position": 2, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } },
                          "any": [
                            { "kind": "string" },
                            { "kind": "template_string" }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "not": {
                          "has": {
                            "nthChild": { "position": 3, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "rule": {
            "kind": "call_expression",
            "has": {
              "field": "function",
              "regex": "^(test|it|describe)\\.(skip|only)$|^(fit|fdescribe|xit|xtest)$"
            },
            "not": {
              "all": [
                {
                  "has": {
                    "field": "function",
                    "regex": "^test\\.skip$"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "matches": "runtime-skip"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "x-note": "The one call left out is the Playwright runtime skip test.skip(condition, reason) made inside a function (a test body, hook or describe callback): the condition is evaluated at run time and skips only that test, or that group when the call sits in a describe callback (accepted: a conditional group skip still runs whenever the condition is false). The condition must reach a runtime value (an identifier, member access, call or await somewhere inside it) and must not be always true by its syntax: after unwrapping parentheses, as, satisfies, non-null and ! it is not a string, template, true, function, arrow, generator, class, object, array, new expression, sequence, spread or globalThis. And the reason must be a string or template; no third argument. So test.skip(), test.skip(true, r), test.skip(1, r), test.skip(!0, r), test.skip(title, fn), a top-level test.skip(cond, r), it.skip(...) (Mocha's it.skip(title, x) really skips) and every .only stay reported. Known gaps: an always-true condition that still names a value (test.skip(true || x, r), test.skip(Boolean(1), r), const S = true; test.skip(S, r)) and Mocha's TDD UI test.skip(titleVar, 'str'), which reads as the Playwright form.",
          "files": [
            "**/*.test.ts",
            "**/*.spec.ts",
            "**/*.test.tsx",
            "**/*.spec.tsx",
            "**/__tests__/**"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "phase": [
    "pre",
    "stop",
    "commit",
    "ci"
  ],
  "feedback": {
    "message": "{symbol} disables or skips automated tests. Step 5 (Musk): automate verification and do not bypass automated test suites."
  }
}
